                        <thead><tr><th style="width:25%;">Term</th><th>Definition</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td><strong>UCDP</strong></td><td>Uniform Collateral Data Portal – electronic delivery system for appraisals to Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>URAR</strong></td><td>Uniform Residential Appraisal Report – standard appraisal form (Form 1004).</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>UAD</strong></td><td>Uniform Appraisal Dataset – standard rules and abbreviations for appraisal data.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>CU</strong></td><td>Collateral Underwriter – Fannie Mae's appraisal risk assessment tool (risk score 1.0–5.0).</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>ACE</strong></td><td>Automated Collateral Evaluation – Freddie Mac's appraisal risk assessment tool.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>AMC</strong></td><td>Appraisal Management Company – independent entity that manages the appraisal process for lenders.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>SSR</strong></td><td>Submission Summary Report – UCDP report showing appraisal submission status.</td></tr>
