                            <tr><td><strong>REO</strong></td><td>Real Estate Owned – property owned by a lender after foreclosure.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>ADU</strong></td><td>Accessory Dwelling Unit – secondary housing unit on the same lot (e.g., granny flat).</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>PUD</strong></td><td>Planned Unit Development – a subdivision with common areas and shared amenities.</td></tr>
                            <tr><td><strong>C6 Condition</strong></td><td>Appraisal rating indicating the property is not in average condition; may require repairs.</td></tr>
